    description: "Pass 13: All 84 analysis_runs entries in self-analysis bm.json have config_fingerprint=sha256:44136fa355b3678a (the SHA256 prefix of literal '{}'). run_signature = hash(pass_id:version:config_fingerprint:toolchain), so within a single pass, run_signature is identical regardless of effective config. Cache keys based on run_signature cannot distinguish runs with different config (e.g., --backend tree-sitter vs --backend rust-analyzer have the same cache key for any given pass)."  # 6dbc
    fields:  # 6dbc
      statement: "AnalysisRun.config_fingerprint reflects a hash of the effective config that produced the run."  # 6dbc
      root_cause: "ir.py:181 _default_config_fingerprint returns sha256(b\\\"{}\\\")[:16]=\\\"44136fa355b3678a\\\" and no pass overrides the default when constructing AnalysisRun, so config_fingerprint is constant regardless of actual config."  # 6dbc
